  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the Pork Belly into slice
  - Chop the Chili onto slice
  - Turn the on the stove to high heat
  - Put the Pan in the Stove
  - Add the Pork Belly
  - Add 2 Cups of water
  - Put the pan lid and boil
  - stir using spatula
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil
  - Add the chop garlic
  - Saute using the spatula
  - Add the chop chili
  - Add 1/2 tbsp of peppercorn
  - 'Add pigs blood '
  - Add 1/2 of vinegar
  - Put the pan lid and simmer
